Single-database Alembic configuration for vectoplan-lv.

Use the Flask application context for all migration commands:

    flask --app app:create_app db revision --autogenerate -m "description"
    flask --app app:create_app db upgrade

The first revisions establish the runnable LV document/version aggregate.
Further models from README_vectoplan-lv.md section 30 follow incrementally.
